  "result": "Perfect! All 167 tests pass. I've added overdue invoice reporting:\n\n**overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)** \u2014 Generates an overdue report:\n\n**Returns:** Array of overdue invoices, each with:\n- `number`: Invoice number\n- `customerId`: Customer ID\n- `dueDate`: Payment due date (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `daysOverdue`: Days past due (asOf - dueDate)\n- `due`: Amount still owed (accounts for payments made)\n\n**Filtering:**\n- Only status 'issued' or 'partially_paid' (excludes drafts and paid)\n- Only invoices with dueDate < asOf (not including due today)\n- Sorted by daysOverdue descending (most overdue first)\n\n**Example:**\n```javascript\nconst allInvoices = [\n  { number: 'INV-2026-0001', dueDate: '2026-10-01', status: 'issued', ... },\n  { number: 'INV-2026-0002', dueDate: '2026-10-10', status: 'issued', ... },\n  { number: 'INV-2026-0003', dueDate: '2026-10-20', status: 'issued', ... }\n];\n\noverdueInvoices(allInvoices, '2026-10-25')\n// Returns:\n// [\n//   { number: 'INV-2026-0001', customerId: 'C-001', dueDate: '2026-10-01', daysOverdue: 24, due: 10230 },\n//   { number: 'INV-2026-0002', customerId: 'C-002', dueDate: '2026-10-10', daysOverdue: 15, due: 8500 }\n// ]\n```\n\n**Tests** (9 new) verify:\n- Basic overdue retrieval\n- Status filtering (issued/partially_paid only)\n- Date filtering (dueDate < asOf)\n- Sorting by days overdue (descending)\n- Invoice detail inclusion\n- Amount calculations\n- Empty list handling\n- Multiple overdue invoices with correct ordering",
